# Build context: app/result
#
# An allow-list, not a deny-list. Everything is excluded first, then the few files
# the image actually needs are added back. A deny-list silently ships anything nobody
# thought to exclude; an allow-list fails visibly instead.
#
# package-lock.json is required: the build runs "npm ci", which refuses to run
# without it. views/ holds index.html, the stylesheet and the two vendored client
# libraries, angular.min.js and socket.io.js.
#
# Maintenance rule: a new file or directory that the image needs must be added here
# in the same commit.

*

!Dockerfile
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!server.js
!views
